{
  "slug": "bedrock",
  "name": "Bedrock",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Second Brain automation for Obsidian vaults — entity management, ingestion, compression, and sync via Claude Code skills",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `ask` (Adaptive vault reader skill), `compress` (Vault alignment engine), `confluence-to-markdown` (Internal fetcher module for Confluence pages), `gdoc-to-markdown` (Internal fetcher module for Google Docs and Sheets), `healthcheck` (Read-only vault health diagnostic), `learn` (Ingests an external data source into the Second Brain), `preserve` (Single write point for the vault), `setup` (Initialize any folder as a Bedrock-powered Obsidian vault), and 2 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install bedrock@claude-community` from `iurykrieger/claude-bedrock`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 10,
    "hook": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Iury Krieger",
    "url": "https://github.com/iurykrieger"
  },
